mah-tulasi-maharani/","title":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā Gīti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":77,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"kabe śrī-chaitanya more karibena dayā"},"title":["Dainya Prārthanā Gīti"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["kabe śrī-chaitanya more karibena dayā","kabe āmi pāiba vaiṣṇava-pada-chhāyā"],"translation":["O when will Śrī Chaitanya bestow upon me His grace? When will I get shelter in the shade of the holy feet of the Vaiṣṇavas?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kabe āmi chhāḍiba e viṣayābhimāna","kabe viṣṇu-jane āmi kariba sammāna"],"translation":["When will I give up the false ego of being an enjoyer and when will I offer all respects to the sincere devotees of Lord Viṣṇu?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gala-vastra kṛtāñjali vaiṣṇava-nikaṭe","dante tṛṇa kari’ dā̐ḍāiba niṣkapaṭe"],"translation":["When will I submit myself by the feet of the Vaiṣṇava with the cloth of surrender around my neck and with straw between my teeth?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["kā̐diyā kā̐diyā jānāiba duḥkha-grāma","saṁsāra-anala haite māgiba viśrāma"],"translation":["Weeping and weeping when will I submit my sorrowful tale at the feet of the Vaiṣṇava, and when will I seek relief from the fire of material suffering praying to that Vaiṣṇava for shelter and rest?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["śuniyā āmāra duḥkha vaiṣṇava ṭhākura","āmā’ lāgi’ kṛṣṇe āvedibena prachura"],"translation":["Upon hearing the tale of my worldly sorrow, that saintly Vaiṣṇava will petition Kṛṣṇa on my behalf in prayer."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["vaiṣṇavera āvedane kṛṣṇa dayāmaya","e hena pāmara prati habena sadaya"],"translation":["Then satisfied by that Vaiṣṇava’s prayer, Kṛṣṇa will be merciful upon this wicked and sinful wretch."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["vinodera nivedana vaiṣṇava-charaṇe","kṛpā kari’ saṅge laha ei akiñchane"],"translation":["Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur submits this prayer at the lotus feet of the Vaiṣṇavas: “Give me your grace and accept this lowly soul in your association.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-kobe-sri","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-kobe-sri","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/kobe-sri-chaitanya","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Dainya-Prārthanā-Gīti-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/kobe-shri-chaitanya-more-koribena-daya/","description":"Dainya Prārthanā Gīti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Dainya Prārthanā Gīti. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"kobe-shri-chaitanya-more-koribena-daya"}}